hpc:User a owl:Class .
hpc:Shareassignmentlist a owl:Class .
hpc:shareassignment a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:usershareassignment a owl:DatatypeProperty .
hpc:Group a owl:Class .
hpc:dynamicsharepriority a owl:DatatypeProperty .

hpc:Usershareassignment rdfs:domain hpc:Queuepartition ;
                          rdfs:range xsd:decimal .
hpc:Shareassignmentlist rdfs:subClassOf rdf:List .
hpc:Shareassignment rdfs:domain hpc:Queuepartition ;
                      rdfs:range hpc:Shareassignmentlist .
hpc:Dynamicsharepriority rdfs:domain hpc:Group ;
                          rdfs:range xsd:decimal .


This ontology fragment defines the classes `User`, `ShareAssignmentList`, `ShareAssignment`, `UserShareAssignment`, `Group`, and `DynamicSharePriority`. It also declares the object property `ShareAssignment` and the datatype properties `UserShareAssignment`, `DynamicSharePriority`. The domain and range of each property are specified using `rdfs:domain` and `rdfs:range`.
